LiveKit model weights
  The voice agent uses LiveKit Agents. LiveKit's local inference models (for
  example its end-of-turn model) are licensed under LiveKit's own model
  license, which allows their use only together with LiveKit Agents. They are
  not part of this repository; LiveKit Agents downloads them when they are used.

Holiday data
